				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Current shape\n\nUse `bvc` for the normal workflow.\n\nUse GemStone and GsDevKit details when you are debugging, tuning, or doing something deliberately advanced. The common path should stay boring. Boring tools are good tools.\n"
